# Linting & Formatting

Linting and Formatting should be configured for every code project so that
formatting discussions can be kept out of PR discussion. Formatting and linting
should be left to the tools. Precommit should be configured to run linters and
formatters prior to push, and CI should validate lint/format.

In practice, every project must have:
- A committed formatter + linter config (e.g. rustfmt/clippy, prettier/eslint,
  ruff/black) checked into the repo.
- A pre-commit hook that runs the formatter and linter before push.
- A CI check that fails the build on any formatting or lint violation.
